      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-07-07T22:22:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes.  This should trigger rescheduling, so the tasks actually get scheduled.  Otherwise, they\u0027ll do their inits in whatever order their interrupts come in.",
      "parentUuid": "135425e3_aa7f035e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 157,
        "startChar": 1,
