        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-07-08T01:27:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, that seems like the right thing to do. Would that be as simple as calling task_wait_event(0) here? Or is it calling svc_handler() with TASK_ID_COUNT-1?",
      "parentUuid": "135425e3_aa7f035e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 157,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 157,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "c0cc29ca1715b125c6ec898bfd37137641eea8a8",
